{
    "name": "Market Research Agent",
    "flow": [
        {
            "id": 2,
            "module": "util:SetVariables",
            "version": 1,
            "parameters": {},
            "mapper": {
                "scope": "roundtrip",
                "variables": [
                    {
                        "name": "Market",
                        "value": "AI Agents"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Specific Focus / Question",
                        "value": "New AI Agent Tools"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Time Scope",
                        "value": "Last Week"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 0,
                    "name": "Adjust These Values"
                },
                "restore": {
                    "expect": {
                        "scope": {
                            "label": "One cycle"
                        },
                        "variables": {
                            "items": [
                                null,
                                null,
                                null
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "expect": [
                    {
                        "name": "variables",
                        "spec": [
                            {
                                "name": "name",
                                "type": "text",
                                "label": "Variable name",
                                "required": true
                            },
                            {
                                "name": "value",
                                "type": "any",
                                "label": "Variable value"
                            }
                        ],
                        "type": "array",
                        "label": "Variables"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "scope",
                        "type": "select",
                        "label": "Variable lifetime",
                        "required": true,
                        "validate": {
                            "enum": [
                                "roundtrip",
                                "execution"
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "interface": [
                    {
                        "name": "Market",
                        "type": "any",
                        "label": "Market"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Specific Focus / Question",
                        "type": "any",
                        "label": "Specific Focus / Question"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Time Scope",
                        "type": "any",
                        "label": "Time Scope"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 3,
            "module": "ai-local-agent:RunLocalAIAgent",
            "version": 0,
            "parameters": {
                "makeConnectionId": null
            },
            "mapper": {
                "files": [],
                "message": "- Market to research: {{2.Market}}\n- Specific focus or question: {{2.`Specific Focus / Question`}}\n- Time scope: {{2.`Time Scope`}}",
                "timeout": "",
                "threadId": "",
                "outputType": "text",
                "modelConfig": {
                    "recursionLimit": 300,
                    "iterationsFromHistoryCount": "10"
                },
                "defaultModel": "gpt-5.4",
                "systemPrompt": "You are a market research agent. You have two tools available: (1) Web Search and (2) Create a Document (Google Docs).\n\n**Your task (high level):**\n1. Research the topic using Web Search.\n2. Synthesize findings into a clear, decision-ready briefing.\n3. Create a Google Doc containing the final briefing by calling the **Create a Document** tool.\n\n## Step-by-step workflow\n\n### 1) Research (tool use required)\n- Use **Web Search** to find the most relevant and recent information related to the market and focus area.\n- Run multiple searches if needed — start broad, then narrow down.\n- Prioritize information within the specified time scope.\n- Cross-check important claims across multiple sources.\n\n### 2) Select findings\n- Identify up to **7** genuinely relevant findings.\n\nFor each finding, include:\n- Title/headline\n- Source name and URL\n- 2–3 sentence summary\n- Category tag: one of [Market Move | Product Launch | Regulation | Partnership | Funding | Trend | Competitor Activity | Consumer Insight | Pricing | Other]\n\n### 3) Write the briefing as clean HTML (no markdown)\nYour entire briefing must be **valid HTML** that can be passed directly to Google Docs.\n\nFormatting rules:\n- Use: <h1> for the report title, <h2> for section headings, <h3> for finding titles, <p> for paragraphs, <a href=\"\"> for source links, <strong> for emphasis, and <table> if comparing data.\n- Do **not** include <html>, <head>, or <body> wrapper tags.\n- Do **not** wrap the output in code blocks or markdown.\n- Keep HTML simple and Google-Docs-friendly.\n\n### 4) Create the Google Doc (tool call required)\nAfter the HTML briefing is complete:\n- Call the **Create a Document** tool.\n- Set:\n  - `name`: a concise document title (include the market and today’s date if helpful)\n  - `content`: the full HTML briefing you wrote\n\n### 5) Final response\nAfter the tool call succeeds:\n- Return the Google Doc link (and/or document ID) to the user.\n- Do not reprint the entire HTML in the final chat response unless explicitly asked.\n\n**Rules:**\n- Only include information you found through Web Search and can link to a source.\n- If searches turn up very little, say so honestly — do not invent or pad findings.\n- Keep summaries concise and jargon-light.\n- Adapt depth to the question (broad scan = breadth; specific question = depth).\n\n**Tone:** Clear, professional, and direct. Write as if briefing someone who needs to make a decision based on this information.",
                "reasoningEffort": "low"
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 300,
                    "y": 0,
                    "name": "Market Research Agent",
                    "messages": [
                        {
                            "category": "setupreq",
                            "severity": "error",
                            "message": "The module is not set up."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "restore": {
                    "expect": {
                        "files": {
                            "mode": "chose"
                        },
                        "outputType": {
                            "label": "Text"
                        },
                        "defaultModel": {
                            "mode": "chose",
                            "label": "GPT-5.4The frontier model for broad, general-purpose work and coding, delivering higher-quality outputs for complex tasks"
                        },
                        "reasoningEffort": {
                            "mode": "chose",
                            "label": "Low"
                        }
                    },
                    "parameters": {
                        "makeConnectionId": {
                            "data": {
                                "scoped": "true",
                                "connection": "ai-provider"
                            },
                            "label": "My OpenAI connection"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "makeConnectionId",
                        "type": "account:ai-provider,openai-gpt-3,anthropic-claude,gemini-ai-q9zyjp,ai-agent-foundry-openai,ai-agent-foundry-non-openai,mistral-ai,cohere,groq,ai-agent-xai,amazon-bedrock,ai-agent-openai-compatible",
                        "label": "Connection",
                        "required": true
                    }
                ],
                "expect": [
                    {
                        "name": "defaultModel",
                        "type": "select",
                        "label": "Model",
                        "required": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "reasoningEffort",
                        "type": "select",
                        "label": "Reasoning effort",
                        "validate": {
                            "enum": [
                                "none",
                                "low",
                                "medium",
                                "high"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "systemPrompt",
                        "type": "text",
                        "label": "Instructions"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "message",
                        "type": "text",
                        "label": "Input",
                        "required": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "files",
                        "spec": [
                            {
                                "name": "fileName",
                                "type": "filename",
                                "label": "File name",
                                "semantic": "file:name"
                            },
                            {
                                "name": "data",
                                "type": "buffer",
                                "label": "Data",
                                "semantic": "file:data"
                            }
                        ],
                        "type": "array",
                        "label": "Input files"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "threadId",
                        "type": "text",
                        "label": "Conversation ID"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "modelConfig",
                        "spec": [
                            {
                                "name": "tokenLimit",
                                "type": "hidden",
                                "label": "Max output tokens"
                            },
                            {
                                "name": "recursionLimit",
                                "type": "hidden",
                                "label": "Steps per agent call"
                            },
                            {
                                "name": "iterationsFromHistoryCount",
                                "type": "number",
                                "label": "Maximum conversation history"
                            }
                        ],
                        "type": "collection",
                        "label": "Model configuration"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "timeout",
                        "type": "number",
                        "label": "Step timeout",
                        "validate": {
                            "max": 600,
                            "min": 120
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "outputType",
                        "type": "select",
                        "label": "Response format",
                        "required": true,
                        "validate": {
                            "enum": [
                                "text",
                                "make-schema"
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "tools": [
                {
                    "name": "Web Search",
                    "description": "Generates a response from web search.",
                    "flow": [
                        {
                            "id": 4,
                            "module": "make-ai-web-search:generateAResponse",
                            "version": 1,
                            "parameters": {},
                            "mapper": {
                                "input": "{{3.input}}",
                                "parseJson": false,
                                "user_location": {
                                    "type": "approximate"
                                }
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 600,
                                    "y": 250
                                },
                                "restore": {
                                    "expect": {
                                        "input": {
                                            "extra": {
                                                "aiHelp": "Enter your search query. For detailed guidance, visit our [Help Center](https://apps.make.com/make-ai-web-search). You can also include specific instructions for the AI to format output as JSON. In that case, make sure to enable the advanced __Parse JSON in response__ option below."
                                            }
                                        },
                                        "parseJson": {
                                            "mode": "chose"
                                        },
                                        "user_location": {
                                            "nested": {
                                                "country": {
                                                    "mode": "chose",
                                                    "label": "Empty"
                                                },
                                                "timezone": {
                                                    "mode": "chose",
                                                    "label": "Empty"
                                                }
                                            }
                                        }
                                    }
                                },
                                "expect": [
                                    {
                                        "name": "input",
                                        "type": "text",
                                        "label": "Text",
                                        "required": true
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "name": "parseJson",
                                        "type": "boolean",
                                        "label": "Parse JSON in response",
                                        "required": true
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "name": "user_location",
                                        "spec": [
                                            {
                                                "name": "type",
                                                "type": "hidden"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "name": "city",
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "label": "City"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "name": "country",
                                                "type": "select",
                                                "label": "Country"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "name": "region",
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "label": "Region"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "name": "timezone",
                                                "type": "select",
                                                "label": "Timezone"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "type": "collection",
                                        "label": "User Location"
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Create a Document",
                    "description": "Creates a new Google document by adding the content of HTML format.",
                    "flow": [
                        {
                            "id": 5,
                            "module": "google-docs:createADocument",
                            "version": 1,
                            "parameters": {
                                "__IMTCONN__": null
                            },
                            "mapper": {
                                "name": "{{3.name}}",
                                "footer": false,
                                "header": false,
                                "content": "{{3.content}}",
                                "folderId": "/",
                                "destination": "drive"
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 600,
                                    "y": 450,
                                    "messages": [
                                        {
                                            "category": "setupreq",
                                            "severity": "error",
                                            "message": "The module is not set up."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                "restore": {
                                    "expect": {
                                        "content": {
                                            "extra": {
                                                "aiHelp": "This parameter supports HTML format."
                                            }
                                        },
                                        "folderId": {
                                            "mode": "chose",
                                            "path": [
                                                "/"
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        "destination": {
                                            "label": "My Drive"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "parameters": {
                                        "__IMTCONN__": {
                                            "data": {
                                                "scoped": "true",
                                                "connection": "google"
                                            },
                                            "label": "Dimitris (d.kamaritis@make.com)"
                                        }
                                    }
                                },
                                "parameters": [
                                    {
                                        "name": "__IMTCONN__",
                                        "type": "account:google",
                                        "label": "Connection",
                                        "required": true
                                    }
                                ],
                                "expect": [
                                    {
                                        "name": "name",
                                        "type": "text",
                                        "label": "Name",
                                        "required": true
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "name": "content",
                                        "type": "text",
                                        "label": "Content",
                                        "required": true
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "name": "destination",
                                        "type": "select",
                                        "label": "Choose a Drive",
                                        "required": true,
                                        "validate": {
                                            "enum": [
                                                "drive",
                                                "share",
                                                "team"
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "name": "header",
                                        "type": "boolean",
                                        "label": "Insert a Header",
                                        "required": true
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "name": "footer",
                                        "type": "boolean",
                                        "label": "Insert a Footer",
                                        "required": true
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "name": "folderId",
                                        "type": "folder",
                                        "label": "New Document's Location",
                                        "required": true
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ],
    "metadata": {
        "instant": false,
        "version": 1,
        "scenario": {
            "roundtrips": 1,
            "maxErrors": 3,
            "autoCommit": true,
            "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
            "sequential": false,
            "slots": null,
            "confidential": false,
            "dataloss": false,
            "dlq": false,
            "freshVariables": false
        },
        "designer": {
            "orphans": []
        },
        "zone": "eu2.make.com",
        "notes": []
    }
}